     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ConceptMap FRIntendedRecipientLMCDAFHIR</b></p><a name=\"en-FRIntendedRecipientLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><a name=\"en-hcFRIntendedRecipientLMCDAFHIR\"> </a><p>This mapping does not specify any particular context of use.</p><br/><p><b>Group 1 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMIntendedRecipient.html\">Logical model - FR LM Intended Recipient</a> to <a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html\">CDA - informationRecipient</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMIntendedRecipient.html#s-FRLMIntendedRecipient\">FRLMIntendedRecipient</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient\">InformationRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient\">InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le destinataire professionnel de santé est de type FRLMHealthProfessional, cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient\">InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le destinataire structure est de type FRLMOrganisation, cf. FROrganisationLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:patient</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient\">InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le destinataire patient/usager est de type FRLMPatient, cf. FRPatientLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:relatedPerson</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient\">InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le destinataire personne liée au patient est de type FRLMRelatedPerson, cf. FRRelatedPersonLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:device</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"https://build.fhir.org/ig/ansforge/interop-IG-cda-document-core/StructureDefinition-fr-cda-information-recipient.html#s-InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient\">InformationRecipient.intendedRecipient</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Le destinataire système est de type FRLMDevice, cf. FRDeviceLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr></table><hr/><p><b>Group 2 </b>Mapping from <a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMIntendedRecipient.html\">Logical model - FR LM Intended Recipient</a> to <a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-information-recipient-extension.html\">Information Recipient Extension</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b>Source Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Relationship</b></td><td><b>Target Code</b></td><td><b>Card.</b></td><td><b>Type</b></td><td><b>Comment</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href=\"StructureDefinition-FRLMIntendedRecipient.html#s-FRLMIntendedRecipient\">FRLMIntendedRecipient</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-information-recipient-extension.html#s-Extension\">Extension</a></td><td>0..*</td><td>todo</td><td/></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:healthProfessional</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/fhir-clinical-document/STU1.1/StructureDefinition-information-recipient-extension.html#s-Extension.extension:party.value[x]\">Extension.extension:party.value[x]</a></td><td>1..1</td><td>todo</td><td>Extension.extension:party.value[x].resolve().ofType(PractitionerRole) — cf. FRHealthProfessionalLMCDAFHIR.</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"3\">FRLMIntendedRecipient.intendedRecipient:organisation</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/R4/codesystem-concept-map-equivalence.html#equivalent\" title=\"equivalent\">is equivalent to</a></td